    {
      "title": "PNB settles ₹43 lakh in claims amid Greater Noida branch fraud allegations",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/pnb-settles-43-lakh-in-claims-amid-greater-noida-branch-fraud-allegations-126102901895_1.html",
      "description": "Punjab National Bank (PNB) on Thursday assured customers that all genuine claims will be honoured and already settled three claims amounting to Rs 43 lakh in connection with alleged financial irregularities involving certain customer fixed and savings bank (SB) deposit accounts at the Greater Noida branch.\nA day after the incident was reported, PNB in a statement said the bank has taken serious cognisance of the complaints and is examining the matter on priority.\n\"Three claims amounting to Rs 43 lakh had been settled as of yesterday. The Bank assures its customers that all genuine claims will be honoured,\" the statement said.\nThe statement said it was extending full cooperation to the authorities concerned and taking necessary steps to verify the facts, assess the extent of the reported discrepancies and address the concerns of affected customers.\nPNB said it follows a zero-tolerance policy towards fraud, financial irregularities and misconduct, adding that stern action would be ta",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-29T17:58:43"
    }
  ]
